        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-27T07:43:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Besides FATE and Cortex (although started before FATE core and Cortex prime) the other game system they admit to having inspired them is Dungeon World/Powered by the Apocalypses.<br>\nI mainly know Cortex from the Margaret Weis Marvel super heroes RPG and remember Dave or Cam talked about the very poor character creation rules in Marvel</p>\n<p>They have also said that they would add new optional rules as they add books so Stress dice and Hitch(s) might an add on modal in the future</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
